 lead='Mustard is a key Rabi oilseed. Its price follows the edible oil market closely.',
 sections=[('Season',['Mustard is a Rabi crop. It is sown around October and harvested around February to March. Rajasthan is the leading mustard state, and it is also grown widely in Haryana, Madhya Pradesh and Uttar Pradesh.']),
 ('Quality',['Oil content and cleanliness affect the price. Store dry and keep the produce free of dust and trash.']),
 ('What moves the price',['- Demand from oil mills.','- Prices of other edible oils.','- Arrivals during and after the harvest.','- Government support such as MSP.']),
 ('Before you sell',[BLOG_DISCLAIMER])],
